You can call me the Judge.{VAR BE01}
Heh heh, that's actually not my real
name, but it's what everyone calls me.{VAR BE01}
It's because of this weird power I have.
It's a gift, really.{VAR BE01}
I can discern--judge, you might say--the
overall potential of individual Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
If you'd like, I could judge the
intriguing potential of your Pokémon.{VAR BE01}

I see, I see...{VAR BE01}
This Pokémon's potential is
decent all around.{VAR BE01}
That's my determination, and it's final.{VAR BE01}

I see, I see...{VAR BE01}
This Pokémon's potential is
above average overall.{VAR BE01}
That's my determination, and it's final.{VAR BE01}

I see, I see...{VAR BE01}
This Pokémon has
relatively superior potential overall.{VAR BE01}
That's my determination, and it's final.{VAR BE01}

I see, I see...{VAR BE01}
This Pokémon has
outstanding potential overall.{VAR BE01}
That's my determination, and it's final.{VAR BE01}
